L0747
@7:8
`Handle` declares `hook(drop)`, so it must say how it is copied
@9:3
`hook(drop)` is declared here
if a copy would release what the hook releases a second time, write `@(move_only)` on its declaration
if a copy must do more than copy each field, declare `hook(copy)`
if copying each field is right, write `@(fieldwise_copy)` on its declaration

